This code provides a complete solution for reading the Melexis MLX91219 current sensor through an external MCP3008 ADC on SPI0 CE0, logging each reading with an ISO-8601 timestamp to a file named `current_log.txt`, and driving a cooling fan on GPIO18 (BCM) based on the sensor reading. It includes error handling for SPI transfers, sensor absence conditions, and signal handling for graceful shutdown.

