This C program interfaces with a Melexis MLX90817 absolute pressure sensor on I2C bus 1 of a Raspberry Pi Zero W. It reads the sensor once per second, appends each measurement to a file named `pressure_log.csv`, and handles errors gracefully. The program uses the `libgpiod` library for I2C communication and checks every I2C call and file operation for errors. It also handles sensor-absent conditions and cleans up resources on receipt of SIGINT or SIGTERM.

