This C program for a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B reads the moisture level from a Vegetronix VH400 sensor connected to an MCP3008 ADC over SPI, logs the reading with a timestamp, and controls a water pump based on the moisture level. The program handles errors, retries failed SPI reads, and ensures proper cleanup on exit.

