This C program continuously reads the Sharp GP2Y0A21YK0F IR distance sensor connected to GPIO17 on a Raspberry Pi 5. It logs each read to a file named `distance_log.txt` with a timestamp, prints "Feeder Activated" to the console when the sensed distance is less than 200 mm, and "Feeder Idle" otherwise. The program handles errors opening or reading the GPIO file by printing an error message and retrying after a one-second delay. It ensures that on receipt of SIGINT or SIGTERM, the program cleanly unexports GPIO17 and exits.

