This C program interfaces with a TDK InvenSense ICU-20201 ultrasonic time-of-flight sensor over SPI on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It continuously reads the distance for an obstacle-avoidance application, logs each timestamp and distance value in millimeters to a file named `distance_log.csv`, and handles errors gracefully. The program uses the `libgpiod` library for GPIO and SPI operations, and it installs a SIGINT/SIGTERM handler to close resources and flush the log file on exit.

