This code provides a complete, compilable C program for a Raspberry Pi Zero W that reads temperature and pressure from a TDK ICP-10101 barometric pressure sensor on the I2C bus. It includes error handling, signal handling for graceful shutdown, and logging of errors to stderr. The program uses the libgpiod library for I2C communication and adheres to the specified requirements.

