This code provides a complete solution for sampling a BMP180 pressure sensor on I2C bus 1 using the libgpiod and pigpio libraries. It includes error handling, a circular buffer for storing timestamped pressure values, and a rolling average calculation. The program asserts an active-HIGH alert on GPIO24 if the current pressure deviates by more than 5 hPa from the average. It also handles I2C failures and sensor absence, and cleans up resources on receipt of SIGINT.

