This code sets up a Raspberry Pi Zero W to continuously poll two SainSmart TTP223B capacitive touch sensors on GPIO4 and GPIO17, drives LEDs on GPIO27 and GPIO22 based on the sensor states, logs every touch and release event in a circular buffer, handles graceful shutdowns, and prints the log buffer on exit.

