This code initializes the I2C devices using the `libgpiod` library, reads 16-bit signed audio samples from two STMicroelectronics IMP23ABSU Ultrasonic MEMS Microphone sensors, timestamps each pair of samples using `CLOCK_REALTIME`, computes the time-difference-of-arrival (TDOA) between the two channels, and appends a line to a CSV-formatted file named `audio_log.dat`. It includes error handling for I2C communication and graceful cleanup on SIGINT signal.

