This code initializes the SPI device and GPIO chip, sets up the SPI parameters, and enters a loop to read the gyroscope and accelerometer registers from the ADIS16448 IMU. It applies the appropriate scales to the raw data and logs the values to the console every 100 ms. The program includes robust error handling for SPI initialization, ioctl transfers, and data reads, and handles SIGINT and SIGTERM to cleanly release resources by closing the SPI device file and the GPIO chip before exiting.

