This code initializes the MPU6886 accelerometer and gyroscope over I2C bus 1 on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It continuously reads the raw 16-bit signed values from the accelerometer and gyroscope, prints them to the console, and handles errors by retrying transient read failures up to three times. It also ensures that the I2C file descriptor is cleanly closed on all exit paths, including when the program receives a SIGINT (Ctrl-C).

