This code sets up an I2C connection to the MPU-6050 gyroscope on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B, reads the X, Y, and Z angular velocities at 10 Hz, and logs the data to a file named `gyro_log.txt` in CSV format. It includes error handling for I2C operations and ensures that all resources are cleaned up properly on exit.

