This C program for a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B creates a smart lighting sunrise effect by gradually increasing the intensity of four SRD-05VDC relay modules over a 30-minute period. It uses the libgpiod library for GPIO control and logs every event with timestamps to a file named `smart_lighting.log`. The program handles errors, ensures clean resource release on all exit paths, and gracefully handles `SIGINT` and `SIGTERM` signals.

