This C program for a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B monitors a PIR motion sensor on GPIO 4 and activates a relay-controlled 12V LED floodlight connected to GPIO 17. It logs events with timestamps and durations to a file named `security_log.txt`. The program handles errors, releases resources on exit, and installs a SIGINT/SIGTERM handler to cleanly turn off the floodlight and release resources.

