This code initializes the MPR121 capacitive touch sensor and a relay on a Raspberry Pi 5 using the libgpiod library. It sets up the I2C bus, configures the MPR121, and toggles the relay on a fresh rising-edge touch of electrode 0 with a 200 ms debounce. The program handles errors, ensures the relay is off at startup and shutdown, and cleans up resources on exit.

