This code provides a complete implementation of a TCP-driven ingredient dispenser using a load cell and a servo motor on a Raspberry Pi 5. It includes error handling, signal handling, and logging of dispensing events. The program listens on `127.0.0.1:12345`, receives a target weight in grams, dispenses the ingredient, reads the actual weight, calibrates the reading, maps the target weight to the servo pulse width, sends the actual weight back to the client, and logs each event.

