This C program for a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B running a 64-bit OS reads range-detection data from a Texas Instruments AWR1642 mmWave radar sensor over UART at 115200 baud, 8N1, with a 0.5-second inter-byte timeout and a select() call with a 2-second timeout. It handles sensor-absent or bus-error conditions, parses complete newline-terminated ASCII lines, logs valid detections to stdout, and ensures a graceful shutdown on SIGINT and SIGTERM.

